      "text": [
        " تَبَارَكَ وَ تَعَالَى فَلا عُدْوانَ إِلّا عَلَى الظّالِمِينَ قَالَ أَوْلَادُ قَتَلَةِ الْحُسَيْنِ (ع) حَدَّثَنِي أَبِي (رحمه الله) عَنْ سَعْدِ بْنِ عَبْدِ اللَّهِ عَنْ إِبْرَاهِيمَ بْنِ هَاشِمٍ وَ مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ الْحُسَيْنِ عَنْ عُثْمَانَ بْنِ عِيسَى عَنْ سَمَاعَةَ بْنِ مِهْرَانَ مِثْلَهُ"
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.sayyid-mohsen-al-husayni-al-milani": [
          "6. Muḥammad ibn Ja’far Al-Razzāz narrated to me from Muḥammad ibn Ḥusain, from ‘Uthmān ibn ‘Isā, from Samā’ah ibn Mihrān, who said: Abū ‘Abdillāh (Imam Sādiq (a.s.)) said, “The verse, ‘There should be no hostility except against the oppressors’ <a href=\"/books/quran:2#h193\">[2:193]</a> refers to the children of the killers of Ḥusain (a.s.).” The above Ḥadīth has also been narrated to me through the following chain: My father, from Sa’d ibn ‘Abdillāh, from Ibrāhīm ibn Hāshim, and from Muḥammad ibn Ḥusain, from ‘Uthmān ibn ‘Isā, from Samā’ah ibn Mihrān, from Abī ‘Abdillāh (a.s.)."
        ]
      }
    },
